      <p>During pregnancy, to support a changing body, relieve the back and pelvis, and prepare for birth through breathing.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="colonne">
      <h3 class="titre-3">Postnatal</h3>
      <p>After the birth, to regain your stability and strength while respecting the pelvic floor. Babies are welcome.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="colonne">
      <h3 class="titre-3">Vinyasa</h3>
      <p>A flowing sequence in which movement follows the breath, to build strength and mobility. You set the intensity.</p>
    </article>
